    "blogtextliquid_LBJgtB": {
      "type": "blogtextliquid",
      "custom_css": [],
      "name": "Blog Text Liquid",
      "settings": {
        "text_content": "<p>There is a particular breed of man who is impossible to buy for, and you almost certainly live with him, work with him, or are related to him. You ask what he wants, and he replies 'nothing really'. He returns half the presents he receives and claims he is 'so easy' to shop for.</p><p>Fragrance is the classic answer, but buying him a generic bottle of whatever is on the front display table at Boots misses the mark completely. If he takes pride in his style, he wants a fragrance with genuine character and presence.</p>"
      }
    },
