    "blogtextliquid_ra7Awx": {
      "type": "blogtextliquid",
      "custom_css": [],
      "name": "Blog Text Liquid",
      "settings": {
        "text_content": "<p>A fragrance lands so well as a gift for one reason: he would rarely buy it for himself. Most men run one bottle into the ground for three years before reluctantly replacing it.</p><p>Giving him a high-performance inspired perfume that punches way above its weight is an immediate upgrade to his daily routine. Here are four fail-safe profiles matched to who he is.</p>"
      }
    },
    "blocks_ji7beH": {
      "type": "_blocks",
      "blocks": {
        "ai_gen_block_614820f_zNd6WG": {
          "type": "ai_gen_block_614820f",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "For The Big Presence vs The Quiet Visionary",
            "heading_size": 42,
            "heading_size_mobile": 28,
            "heading_line_height": 1.1,
            "heading_color": "#1A1816",
            "heading_margin_bottom": 30,
            "heading_margin_bottom_mobile": 25,
            "column_1_text": "<p><strong>Fierce</strong> (inspired by Sauvage Parfum by Dior) is for the man who fills a doorway. Big presence, strong opinions, the sort of person people clock the second he walks into a room.</p><p>The spicy bergamot opening and bold ambroxan base make an undeniable impression. It is sharp, confident, and lasts through an entire workday.</p>",
            "column_2_text": "<p><strong>Visionary</strong> (inspired by Imagination by Louis Vuitton) is for the man who fancies himself an aesthete. He reads the long articles, has thoughts on architecture, and appreciates subtle craftsmanship.</p><p>Opening with sparkling Calabrian citrus and Chinese black tea, it is sophisticated, airy, and unexpectedly luxurious.</p>",
            "body_size": 17,
            "body_size_mobile": 15,
            "body_line_height": 1.9,
            "body_color": "#2D2A26",
            "paragraph_spacing": 20,
            "column_gap": 55,
            "column_gap_mobile": 30,
            "max_width": 1100,
            "desktop_width_percent": 100,
            "background_color": "#FAF8F5",
            "padding_top": 60,
            "padding_bottom": 60,
            "padding_horizontal": 40,
            "padding_top_mobile": 40,
            "padding_bottom_mobile": 40,
            "padding_horizontal_mobile": 20
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "ai_gen_block_614820f_zNd6WG"
      ],
      "name": "Editorial text section",
      "settings": {}
    },
    "1778690749e24fd023": {
      "type": "_blocks",
      "blocks": {
        "ai_gen_block_fb81b45_9nTtAA": {
          "type": "ai_gen_block_fb81b45",
          "settings": {
            "desktop_width_percent": 100,
            "max_width": 1100,
            "section_padding": 60,
            "background_color": "#FAF8F5",
            "heading": "<p>Addiction & Mirage: treats worth giving</p>",
            "heading_size": 42,
            "heading_color": "#1A1816",
            "heading_spacing": 25,
            "box_color": "#1C1917",
            "box_radius": 15,
            "box_padding": 45,
            "box_spacing": 35,
            "box_paragraph_1": "<p>If he has had a big year, or he is simply someone you want to spoil a little, <strong>Addiction</strong> (inspired by Baccarat Rouge 540) is an unforgettable treat. The amberwood and saffron sillage smells considerably more expensive than it has any right to.</p><p>For someone you do not know all that well yet—like an office Secret Santa or a brother-in-law—<strong>Mirage</strong> offers clean powdery iris and smooth cedar that is impossible to dislike.</p><p>Every bottle comes presented in our signature gift-ready presentation box.</p>",
            "box_paragraph_2": "",
            "box_paragraph_3": "",
            "box_text_color": "#F5EFE6",
            "box_text_size": 17,
            "box_text_line_height": 1.9,
            "paragraph_spacing": 20,
            "subheading": "<p>Why inspired fragrance makes the best gift</p>",
            "subheading_size": 42,
            "subheading_color": "#1A1816",
            "subheading_spacing": 40,
            "bottom_text": "<p>He gets the exact same luxury scent experience as a £250 department store bottle, without you having to spend a fortune.</p><p>It looks handsome on his dresser, lasts all day on his skin, and solves the gift dilemma in five minutes.</p>",
            "bottom_text_size": 17,
            "bottom_text_color": "#2D2A26",
            "bottom_text_line_height": 1.9
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "ai_gen_block_fb81b45_9nTtAA"
      ],
      "settings": {}
    },
